// 2026-11-01-dual3090-strata-gsq.jsonc — Strata engine-version comparison on the
// main GPU server (dual RTX 3090, PCIe 4.0 x16 cap / x8 actual, no AVX-512).
//
// Question: does the pinned upstream Strata build change decode speed,
// concurrency, or long-context recall over the deployed control, on the same
// artifact and the same serving layer?
//
// The control arm is the production configuration byte-for-byte (same pack, same
// resident budget, same speculative settings) so the only variable is the engine
// build. The candidate arm additionally gets a 128K context cell, reported as a
// fit/no-fit result, not as a speed claim.
//
// No roster change is claimed by this campaign; it produces candidates for review.
{
  "id": "2026-11-01-dual3090-strata-gsq",
  "question": "does the pinned upstream Strata build change decode speed, concurrency, or long-context recall over the deployed control on the same artifact",
  "owner": "mf",
